# The mutation-evidence ledgers are append-only: every task appends its
# evidence block at the EOF, so two sibling delivery branches always textually
# conflict there even when their code is disjoint (the PR #9 / PR #11 class,
# 2026-09-06). The built-in `union` driver auto-resolves both-append conflicts
# by keeping BOTH sides — safe precisely because these files are append-only
# evidence records, never edited in place. Scoped tightly: no other file gets
# this treatment (DEPARTMENT_STATUS.md has structural edits and stays on the
# default merge).
docs/mutation-evidence-phase*.md merge=union
